commit e3faf053
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 17:10:51 -0600
subject: feat(failover): L2 proxy status endpoint + dashboard card

- cli/failover-proxy.cjs: answer GET /api/failover-status locally (control
  plane, never forwarded upstream): local up state, active target, peer list,
  loop protection flag, uptime.
- dashboard proxy-pools page: FailoverStatusCard polls /api/system/failover-status
  every 5s, shows Local Node UP/DOWN, Active Target, Peer Nodes, port, uptime,
  offline state when proxy unreachable.
- api/system/failover-status route: server-side fetch to the L2 proxy process
  (FAILOVER_PROXY_PORT env, default 20140), CORS mirroring /api/health.
- tests: T9 covers the control-plane endpoint shape + loop-protection pass-through.

Notes: proxy-pools repo/API/UI were already integrated (stale open issue);
card open issues resolved: schema repo exists, UI exists, dashboard panel added.


